            <ArticleTitle>[Acupuncture in ischemic pain of the extremities].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1725-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this paper is put in evidence the efficacy of reflexotherapy (acupuncture) in the treatment of ischemic pain. The vasodilatation obtained brings back to a normal aerobic glicolisis in the ischemic tissues, especially in the muscles and consequentially a total or partial analgesic effect.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
